                    <Text style={{ width: 80, fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#276FBF' }}>295</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>第 1–3 层：较易到很难</Text>
